  "sourceTitle": "VisTW: a Traditional Chinese vision benchmark that tests whether your VLM can actually read Taiwan",
  "sourceBodyHash": "86b3fb7614573e46f24181e8445b7bd042eec75e22ebbee717527e9266cbb61e",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T12:41:19.584670Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T12:42:36.975332Z",
  "totalBlocks": 22,
  "translatedBlocks": 22,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c56d3b89576fae17",
      "translationZh": "我想让人们注意一个我认为值得更多关注的基准，并提到我们已经为其添加了支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20118e7c6f9b7937",
      "translationZh": "如果你看看我们大多数人用来评估 VLM 的工具 — — MMBench、MMStar、MMMU、POPE — — 它们全是英文或简体中文。一个模型在这些测试中可以得分很高，但在台湾的路标、收据、健康保险卡或当地学校教材中的图表上仍可能失败。之前没有人在衡量这一点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71eb57dec1da39e8",
      "translationZh": "VisTW（NTU MiuLab，arXiv 2503.10427，CC BY 4.0）正好衡量这一点。它有两个子集：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cb3cb29facefe02",
      "translationZh": "VisTW-MCQ — 来自21个学科真实考试的4,770道选择题。包含图表、电路图、乐谱、医学影像、地图。题目和选项全部使用繁体中文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c8b9420def83c18",
      "translationZh": "VisTW-Dialogue — 141个关于台湾日常场景的开放式问题，由LLM评判员打0–10分。这一方法侧重于文化背景而非教科书知识。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "432571367ff34e51",
      "translationZh": "为了了解规模，他们的排行榜显示 gemma-3-12b-it 在 MCQ 上得分 0.4863，在 Dialogue 上得分 3.94，而 o3 位居榜首，得分约为 0.7769 / 6.9878。该排行榜自2025年4月以来未更新，因此较新的模型未被收录。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb656d0ff3df751",
      "translationZh": "官方仓库：TMMMU-Benchmark/evaluation",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e38be2ec5cbb41ef",
      "translationZh": "Twinkle Eval 是一个开源的评估框架，可运行在任何 OpenAI 兼容端点上。从 v2.10.0 开始，VisTW 的两个子集均受支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8c120afde6afd44",
      "translationZh": "在声称它有效之前，我们将其与官方实现进行了对比 — — 使用相同的模型、相同的端点，以及按比例抽取的全部21个学科的253道题目：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "987aa097f7f2e93d",
      "translationZh": "相差0.45分。我们记录了为使双方在同一起点上需要对官方仓库进行的四项更改，这样任何人都可以检查我们的工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08fa8b9f744accdc",
      "translationZh": "比较实际上发现了什么",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3cb5ab2fae25a3d",
      "translationZh": "值得分享，因为这是冒烟测试通常会漏掉的那类问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e3f86e37ee1edce",
      "translationZh": "有一门学科的得分比官方实现低36分。原因在于我们：官方提示告诉模型以 答案: 字母 的形式作答，模型会复制那个美元符号，而我们的提取器无法匹配 答案: A 。更糟的是，它随后回退到一个较宽松的模式，从推理文本中挑选出一个字母——导致正确答案被判为错误，且输出中没有任何指示表明出现了问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7c6bd859b9cbb79",
      "translationZh": "21题的冒烟测试集未显示任何问题。只有完整的253题才能发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e575141270c0d62",
      "translationZh": "现已修复。这一个错误曾抑制了五种不同视觉基准的得分，而不仅仅是VisTW。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7fe098458a35332",
      "translationZh": "使用前值得了解的事项",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62dbec643ee6e5b6",
      "translationZh": "官方实现有一个第三个提取阶段，会调用 LLM 来解析其正则表达式遗漏的响应。我们故意不这样做，因为这会把“模型回答得有多差”与“解析器猜得有多好”混在一起——我们改为报告 unparsed_rate，以便让差距保持可见。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "084580b93d5bc788",
      "translationZh": "Reasoning VLMs 需要大量的余量。At max_tokens: 2048 我们测量到有 19% 的响应在答案之前被截断，导致准确率下降 19 分。Templates 的设置为 8192。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "499b76bdffe49f59",
      "translationZh": "对于 Dialogue，0–10 的平均值目前尚未出现在 summary JSON 中——你需要从每个问题的输出中进行聚合。此问题已被跟踪为一个未解决的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5684b91f703ef54",
      "translationZh": "如果你只想先检查你的端点是否工作，仓库中有一个 21 问题的示例集。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e3bfb1b87c7d06c",
      "translationZh": "我很乐意回答关于基准或集成的任何问题。此外，如果你发现我们的数字有误，我更希望你告诉我。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c01323eac40661c",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/piske_usagi 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
